<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ORVIX Technology – AI solutions for business</title>
<meta name="description" content="ORVIX Technology builds AI chatbots, automation and custom software for businesses. Founder and CEO: Ayush Kumar.">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500;700;800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F4F7FB;--surface:#FFFFFF;--ink:#0F172A;--muted:#51607A;--line:#DDE5F0;
  --navy:#0B1B3A;--navy-ink:#EAF0FF;--navy-muted:#A9B8D6;--navy-line:#1D2F57;--navy-accent:#6EA8FF;
  --accent:#2563EB;--on-accent:#FFFFFF;--accent-soft:#E6EEFF;--mint:#0F9D78;
  --glow:rgba(37,99,235,.14);
  --display:"Bricolage Grotesque","Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;
  --body:"Instrument Sans",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0A1220;--surface:#111C30;--ink:#EAF0FA;--muted:#9AA8C2;--line:#233250;
  --navy:#050B16;--navy-line:#16233F;
  --accent:#5B9BFF;--on-accent:#06101F;--accent-soft:#16264A;--mint:#5FE0BB;
  --glow:rgba(91,155,255,.18);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:70px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.6 var(--body);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit}
button,input,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:22px;padding-right:22px}
#progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:0;background:var(--accent);z-index:20}

header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:var(--navy);border-bottom:1px solid var(--navy-line)}
header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:62px}
.logo{font:800 22px var(--display);letter-spacing:.06em;text-decoration:none;color:#fff}
nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--navy-muted)}
nav a:hover{color:#fff}
.icon-btn{border:1px solid var(--navy-line);background:transparent;color:#fff;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;line-height:1}
#toTop{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:18px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s;background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy)}
#toTop.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
#menuBtn{display:none}
@media(max-width:940px){
  #menuBtn{display:block}
  nav{position:absolute;top:62px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--navy);border-bottom:1px solid var(--navy-line);flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:16px 22px;gap:14px;display:none}
  nav.open{display:flex}
}

.herobg{position:relative;color:#fff;background:#0B1B3A url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=70") center/cover no-repeat}
.herobg::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,27,58,.93),rgba(11,27,58,.78) 55%,rgba(11,27,58,.55))}
.hero{position:relative;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:56px;display:grid;gap:28px;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;align-items:center}
@media(max-width:800px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px}.orbit{display:none}}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px}
.pill i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#4ADE80;display:inline-block}
h1{font:800 clamp(38px,7.5vw,68px)/1.03 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 18px;color:#fff}
#typed{color:var(--navy-accent)}
.caret{display:inline-block;width:3px;height:.9em;background:var(--navy-accent);margin-left:3px;vertical-align:-.1em;animation:blink 1s steps(1) infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
.lead{font-size:19px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.84);max-width:50ch;margin:0 0 24px}
.btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:transparent;cursor:pointer}
.btn.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent);box-shadow:0 8px 22px var(--glow)}
.herobg .btn{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);color:#fff}
.herobg .btn.primary{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent)}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:14px;font-weight:500}
.chips span::before{content:"✓ ";color:#4ADE80;font-weight:700}
.orbit{width:100%;max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;display:block}
.orbit .ring{fill:none;stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.2);stroke-width:1.5}
.orbit .core{fill:var(--navy-accent)}
.orbit .dot{fill:var(--navy-accent)}
.orbit .dot2{fill:#fff}
.spin{transform-origin:200px 200px;animation:spin 28s linear infinite}
.spin.r{animation-duration:46s;animation-direction:reverse}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.spin,.caret{animation:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}}

.tech{padding-top:34px;padding-bottom:36px}
.tech p{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
.tech div{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tech span{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}

.band{background:var(--navy);color:var(--navy-ink)}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:18px;padding-top:34px;padding-bottom:34px}
.stat b{display:block;font:800 clamp(32px,6vw,46px)/1 var(--display);color:#fff}
.stat span{color:var(--navy-muted);font-size:15px}

section{padding:60px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.band+section{border-top:0}
h2{font:700 clamp(28px,5vw,40px)/1.1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 10px}
.sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 30px;max-width:58ch}

.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}
.card h3{font:700 20px var(--display);margin:0 0 6px}
.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.ico{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:12px}
.also{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}

.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}
@media(max-width:800px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.ticks{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 22px;display:grid;gap:10px}
.ticks li::before{content:"✓ ";color:var(--mint);font-weight:700}
.phone{max-width:300px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;background:var(--navy);border-radius:34px;padding:10px;box-shadow:0 24px 50px var(--glow)}
.screen{background:var(--surface);border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden}
.ph-head{background:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent);padding:12px 14px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.ph-head i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#4ADE80;display:inline-block}
.ph-body{padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;background:var(--bg);min-height:330px}
.b{max-width:86%;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}
.b.u{align-self:flex-end;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:4px}
.b.a{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-left-radius:4px}
.cap{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}

.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
.chip{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:500}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:18px}
.proj{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.proj[hidden]{display:none}
.thumb{height:120px;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 30px var(--display);color:#fff;letter-spacing:.02em}
.t1{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1B3A,#1E3A8A)}
.t2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0F172A,#334155)}
.t3{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1E3A8A,#2563EB)}
.t4{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#134E4A,#0F766E)}
.t5{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1E293B,#475569)}
.t6{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#312E81,#4F46E5)}
.pbody{padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex:1}
.pbody h3{font:700 21px var(--display);margin:0}
.pbody p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.result{font-weight:600;color:var(--mint);font-size:15px}
.tag{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;margin-right:6px}
.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:18px}

.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:18px;counter-reset:s}
.step{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)}
.step::before{counter-increment:s;content:"0" counter(s);font:800 30px var(--display);display:block;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--accent)}
.step h3{font:700 19px var(--display);margin:0 0 4px}
.step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}

section.navy{background:var(--navy);color:var(--navy-ink);border-top:0}
section.navy .sub,section.navy .note{color:var(--navy-muted)}
section.navy .card,section.navy .review{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-color:var(--navy-line)}
section.navy .card p{color:var(--navy-muted)}
section.navy .ico{background:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent)}
.reviews{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:22px}
.review{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}
.review p{margin:0 0 12px}
.review b{display:block}
.review span{color:var(--navy-muted);font-size:14px}
.stars{color:#F5B301;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px}

.chat{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;max-width:640px;overflow:hidden}
.chat-head{padding:12px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.chat-head i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);display:inline-block}
#log{height:300px;overflow-y:auto;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.msg{max-width:85%;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:16px;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.msg.bot{background:var(--bg);align-self:flex-start;border-bottom-left-radius:4px}
.msg.me{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;align-self:flex-end;border-bottom-right-radius:4px}
.msg.wait{color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}
.quick{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 16px 12px}
.quick button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}
.chat form{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.chat input{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 16px;min-width:0}
.chat button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait}

.people{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.avatar{width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 34px var(--display);flex:none}
.people h3{font:700 24px var(--display);margin:0}
.role{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin:2px 0 8px}
.people p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:52ch}

details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0}
summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:18px}
details p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch}

.cgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px}
@media(max-width:760px){.cgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
form.contact{display:grid;gap:12px}
label{font-weight:500;font-size:15px;display:grid;gap:4px}
.contact input,.contact textarea{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 14px;width:100%}
.contact textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
.err{color:#DC2626;font-size:14px;min-height:18px}
#thanks{color:var(--mint);font-weight:600}
.info p{margin:0 0 16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.info a{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
footer{background:var(--navy);color:var(--navy-muted);padding:26px 0 34px;font-size:14px}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="progress"></div>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="logo" href="#top">ORVIX</a>
    <nav id="nav" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#work">Portfolio</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#trust">Why us</a>
      <a href="#demo">AI demo</a>
      <a href="#team">Leadership</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
      <button class="icon-btn" id="themeBtn" aria-label="Switch light or dark theme">🌙</button>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <div class="herobg">
    <div class="wrap hero">
      <div>
        <div class="pill"><i></i>Taking new projects</div>
        <h1>AI that <span id="typed"></span><span class="caret"></span></h1>
        <p class="lead">ORVIX Technology builds AI chatbots, automation and custom software that save your team time and win you more customers.</p>
        <div class="btns">
          <a class="btn primary" href="#contact">Get a free estimate</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#work">See our work</a>
        </div>
        <div class="chips"><span>Reply within 1 day</span><span>Founder-led team</span><span>Support after launch</span></div>
      </div>
      <svg class="orbit" viewBox="0 0 400 400" role="img" aria-label="Orbit illustration">
        <circle class="ring" cx="200" cy="200" r="70"/><circle class="ring" cx="200" cy="200" r="120"/><circle class="ring" cx="200" cy="200" r="170"/>
        <circle class="core" cx="200" cy="200" r="30"/>
        <g class="spin"><circle class="dot" cx="270" cy="200" r="10"/><circle class="dot2" cx="200" cy="30" r="8"/></g>
        <g class="spin r"><circle class="dot2" cx="80" cy="200" r="9"/><circle class="dot" cx="200" cy="370" r="12"/></g>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap tech">
    <p>Technologies we work with</p>
    <div><span>Python</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>React</span><span>Node.js</span><span>Cloud</span><span>WhatsApp API</span><span>Gemini and Claude AI</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="band">
    <div class="wrap stats">
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="25" data-suffix="+">25+</b><span>Projects delivered</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="15" data-suffix="+">15+</b><span>Happy clients</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="5" data-suffix="">5</b><span>AI products</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>24/7</b><span>Support after launch</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="services"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>What we build</h2>
    <p class="sub">Three things we do best, from first idea to launch.</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><div class="ico">💬</div><h3>AI chatbots</h3><p>Support and sales assistants for your website and WhatsApp that answer in seconds, day and night.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="ico">⚙️</div><h3>Process automation</h3><p>Remove repetitive work: reports, data entry, emails, invoices and approvals.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="ico">🧩</div><h3>Custom AI software</h3><p>Web and mobile apps with AI built in, designed around how your business works.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="also">Also available: dashboards, websites and AI training for your team.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section id="inaction"><div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h2>See it in action</h2>
      <p class="sub">Here is how an ORVIX chatbot handles a booking on WhatsApp, with no staff involved.</p>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>Replies in seconds, any time of day</li>
        <li>Understands Hindi, English and Hinglish</li>
        <li>Hands over to your team when needed</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn primary" href="#demo">Try the live assistant</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="phone" role="img" aria-label="Mockup of a chatbot handling a table booking">
        <div class="screen">
          <div class="ph-head"><i></i>Your business assistant</div>
          <div class="ph-body">
            <div class="b u">Hi, do you have a table for 4 tomorrow at 8?</div>
            <div class="b a">Yes! Tomorrow 8:00 PM for 4 people is open. Shall I book it under your name?</div>
            <div class="b u">Yes, Rahul</div>
            <div class="b a">Done ✅ Your booking is confirmed. I will send a reminder 2 hours before.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cap">Sample conversation for illustration</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="work"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>Selected work</h2>
    <p class="sub">A look at the kind of results we build for clients.</p>
    <div class="filters" id="filters">
      <button class="chip" data-f="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="chatbot" aria-pressed="false">Chatbots</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="automation" aria-pressed="false">Automation</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="software" aria-pressed="false">Software</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="web" aria-pressed="false">Websites</button>
    </div>
    <div class="work">
      <article class="proj" data-cat="chatbot"><div class="thumb t1" aria-hidden="true">AI Chat</div><div class="pbody"><h3>Support assistant</h3><p>Answers common customer questions and hands over to staff when needed.</p><div class="result">Result: 60% fewer support calls</div><div><span class="tag">Chatbot</span><span class="tag">AI</span></div></div></article>
      <article class="proj" data-cat="automation"><div class="thumb t2" aria-hidden="true">Auto</div><div class="pbody"><h3>Invoice automation</h3><p>Reads invoices, extracts details and posts them to accounting without typing.</p><div class="result">Result: 15 hours saved every week</div><div><span class="tag">Automation</span><span class="tag">OCR</span></div></div></article>
      <article class="proj" data-cat="software"><div class="thumb t3" aria-hidden="true">Dash</div><div class="pbody"><h3>Sales insights dashboard</h3><p>One live screen for sales, stock and team results with AI-written summaries.</p><div class="result">Result: decisions in minutes, not days</div><div><span class="tag">Software</span><span class="tag">Data</span></div></div></article>
      <article class="proj" data-cat="chatbot"><div class="thumb t4" aria-hidden="true">Chat</div><div class="pbody"><h3>WhatsApp booking bot</h3><p>Customers book appointments by chatting, and reminders go out automatically.</p><div class="result">Result: 3x more bookings</div><div><span class="tag">Chatbot</span><span class="tag">WhatsApp</span></div></div></article>
      <article class="proj" data-cat="web"><div class="thumb t5" aria-hidden="true">Web</div><div class="pbody"><h3>Business website</h3><p>A fast mobile-first website with enquiry forms and search-friendly pages.</p><div class="result">Result: 2x more enquiries</div><div><span class="tag">Website</span><span class="tag">SEO</span></div></div></article>
      <article class="proj" data-cat="software"><div class="thumb t6" aria-hidden="true">App</div><div class="pbody"><h3>Staff management app</h3><p>Attendance, tasks and payroll in one simple mobile app for small teams.</p><div class="result">Result: paperwork cut by half</div><div><span class="tag">Mobile app</span><span class="tag">Software</span></div></div></article>
    </div>
    <p class="note">These are sample projects. Replace them with your real client work.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section id="process"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p class="sub">Simple, clear and fast. You always know what happens next.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><h3>Discover</h3><p>We listen to your goals and study your process.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><h3>Design</h3><p>We plan the solution and share a clear price and timeline.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><h3>Build</h3><p>We build in small steps and show you progress every week.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><h3>Launch and support</h3><p>We go live, train your team and keep improving.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="trust" class="navy"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>Why businesses trust ORVIX</h2>
    <p class="sub">Small team, direct access to the founder, and results you can measure.</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><div class="ico">🤝</div><h3>Founder-led</h3><p>You speak directly with Ayush Kumar, not a call centre.</p></div>
